{"audio": "john-10.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 250533, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 1600, "text": "John, Chapter Ten."}, {"start_ms": 1600, "end_ms": 11200, "text": "Verily, verily, I say unto you, He that entereth not by the door into the sheepfold, but climbeth up some other way, the same is a thief and a robber."}, {"start_ms": 11200, "end_ms": 14800, "text": "But he that entereth in by the door is the shepherd of the sheep."}, {"start_ms": 14800, "end_ms": 21333, "text": "To him the porter openeth; and the sheep hear his voice: and he calleth his own sheep by name, and leadeth them out."}, {"start_ms": 21333, "end_ms": 28133, "text": "And when he putteth forth his own sheep, he goeth before them, and the sheep follow him: for they know his voice."}, {"start_ms": 28133, "end_ms": 33600, "text": "And a stranger will they not follow, but will flee from him: for they know not the voice of strangers."}, {"start_ms": 33600, "end_ms": 39733, "text": "This parable spake Jesus unto them: but they understood not what things they were which he spake unto them."}, {"start_ms": 39733, "end_ms": 46133, "text": "Then said Jesus unto them again, Verily, verily, I say unto you, I am the door of the sheep."}, {"start_ms": 46133, "end_ms": 51467, "text": "All that ever came before me are thieves and robbers: but the sheep did not hear them."}, {"start_ms": 51467, "end_ms": 57467, "text": "I am the door: by me if any man enter in, he shall be saved, and shall go in and out, and find pasture."}, {"start_ms": 57467, "end_ms": 67200, "text": "The thief cometh not, but for to steal, and to kill, and to destroy: I am come that they might have life, and that they might have it more abundantly."}, {"start_ms": 67200, "end_ms": 70800, "text": "I am the good shepherd: the good shepherd giveth his life for the sheep."}, {"start_ms": 70800, "end_ms": 81600, "text": "But he that is an hireling, and not the shepherd, whose own the sheep are not, seeth the wolf coming, and leaveth the sheep, and fleeth: and the wolf catcheth them, and scattereth the sheep."}, {"start_ms": 81600, "end_ms": 85733, "text": "The hireling fleeth, because he is an hireling, and careth not for the sheep."}, {"start_ms": 85733, "end_ms": 89467, "text": "I am the good shepherd, and know my sheep, and am known of mine."}, {"start_ms": 89467, "end_ms": 95333, "text": "As the Father knoweth me, even so know I the Father: and I lay down my life for the sheep."}, {"start_ms": 95333, "end_ms": 102933, "text": "And other sheep I have, which are not of this fold: them also I must bring, and they shall hear my voice; and there shall be one fold, and one shepherd."}, {"start_ms": 102933, "end_ms": 108533, "text": "Therefore doth my Father love me, because I lay down my life, that I might take it again."}, {"start_ms": 108533, "end_ms": 111867, "text": "No man taketh it from me, but I lay it down of myself."}, {"start_ms": 111867, "end_ms": 115467, "text": "I have power to lay it down, and I have power to take it again."}, {"start_ms": 115467, "end_ms": 118667, "text": "This commandment have I received of my Father."}, {"start_ms": 118667, "end_ms": 122533, "text": "There was a division therefore again among the Jews for these sayings."}, {"start_ms": 122533, "end_ms": 127733, "text": "And many of them said, He hath a devil, and is mad; why hear ye him?"}, {"start_ms": 127733, "end_ms": 131600, "text": "Others said, These are not the words of him that hath a devil."}, {"start_ms": 131600, "end_ms": 134133, "text": "Can a devil open the eyes of the blind?"}, {"start_ms": 134133, "end_ms": 138133, "text": "And it was at Jerusalem the feast of the dedication, and it was winter."}, {"start_ms": 138133, "end_ms": 141067, "text": "And Jesus walked in the temple in Solomon's porch."}, {"start_ms": 141067, "end_ms": 147067, "text": "Then came the Jews round about him, and said unto him, How long dost thou make us to doubt?"}, {"start_ms": 147067, "end_ms": 150000, "text": "If thou be the Christ, tell us plainly."}, {"start_ms": 150000, "end_ms": 158000, "text": "Jesus answered them, I told you, and ye believed not: the works that I do in my Father's name, they bear witness of me."}, {"start_ms": 158000, "end_ms": 162133, "text": "But ye believe not, because ye are not of my sheep, as I said unto you."}, {"start_ms": 162133, "end_ms": 172000, "text": "My sheep hear my voice, and I know them, and they follow me: And I give unto them eternal life; and they shall never perish, neither shall any man pluck them out of my hand."}, {"start_ms": 172000, "end_ms": 178400, "text": "My Father, which gave them me, is greater than all; and no man is able to pluck them out of my Father's hand."}, {"start_ms": 178400, "end_ms": 180667, "text": "I and my Father are one."}, {"start_ms": 180667, "end_ms": 183733, "text": "Then the Jews took up stones again to stone him."}, {"start_ms": 183733, "end_ms": 190800, "text": "Jesus answered them, Many good works have I shewed you from my Father; for which of those works do ye stone me?"}, {"start_ms": 190800, "end_ms": 199867, "text": "The Jews answered him, saying, For a good work we stone thee not; but for blasphemy; and because that thou, being a man, makest thyself God."}, {"start_ms": 199867, "end_ms": 204267, "text": "Jesus answered them, Is it not written in your law, I said, Ye are gods?"}, {"start_ms": 204267, "end_ms": 218667, "text": "If he called them gods, unto whom the word of God came, and the scripture cannot be broken; Say ye of him, whom the Father hath sanctified, and sent into the world, Thou blasphemest; because I said, I am the Son of God?"}, {"start_ms": 218667, "end_ms": 222133, "text": "If I do not the works of my Father, believe me not."}, {"start_ms": 222133, "end_ms": 230800, "text": "But if I do, though ye believe not me, believe the works: that ye may know, and believe, that the Father is in me, and I in him."}, {"start_ms": 230800, "end_ms": 241200, "text": "Therefore they sought again to take him: but he escaped out of their hand, And went away again beyond Jordan into the place where John at first baptized; and there he abode."}, {"start_ms": 241200, "end_ms": 248933, "text": "And many resorted unto him, and said, John did no miracle: but all things that John spake of this man were true."}, {"start_ms": 248933, "end_ms": 250533, "text": "And many believed on him there."}], "words": [{"t": "John,", "s": 324, "e": 648, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 830, "e": 1215, "si": 0}, {"t": "Ten.", "s": 1296, "e": 1539, "si": 0}, {"t": "Verily,", "s": 2181, "e": 2562, "si": 1}, {"t": "verily,", "s": 2682, "e": 3003, "si": 1}, {"t": "I", "s": 3143, "e": 3163, "si": 1}, {"t": "say", "s": 3263, "e": 3404, "si": 1}, {"t": "unto", "s": 3464, "e": 3624, "si": 1}, {"t": "you,", "s": 3704, "e": 3845, "si": 1}, {"t": "He", "s": 4486, "e": 4546, "si": 1}, {"t": "that", "s": 4646, "e": 4767, "si": 1}, {"t": "entereth", "s": 4867, "e": 5228, "si": 1}, {"t": "not", "s": 5288, "e": 5488, "si": 1}, {"t": "by", "s": 5548, "e": 5668, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 5689, "e": 5769, "si": 1}, {"t": "door", "s": 5829, "e": 6049, "si": 1}, {"t": "into", "s": 6190, "e": 6350, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 6370, "e": 6450, "si": 1}, {"t": "sheepfold,", "s": 6530, "e": 7172, "si": 1}, {"t": "but", "s": 7452, "e": 7572, "si": 1}, {"t": "climbeth", "s": 7613, "e": 8013, "si": 1}, {"t": "up", "s": 8033, "e": 8134, "si": 1}, {"t": "some", "s": 8214, "e": 8394, "si": 1}, {"t": "other", "s": 8414, "e": 8575, "si": 1}, {"t": "way,", "s": 8635, "e": 8875, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 9296, "e": 9396, "si": 1}, {"t": "same", "s": 9476, "e": 9757, "si": 1}, {"t": "is", "s": 9777, "e": 9857, "si": 1}, {"t": "a", "s": 9897, "e": 9917, "si": 1}, {"t": "thief", "s": 10018, "e": 10258, "si": 1}, {"t": "and", "s": 10519, "e": 10619, "si": 1}, {"t": "a", "s": 10639, "e": 10659, "si": 1}, {"t": "robber.", "s": 10739, "e": 11060, "si": 1}, {"t": "But", "s": 11441, "e": 11542, "si": 2}, {"t": "he", "s